{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":33,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求救的祈禱"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"禍哉！你這毀滅人的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己倒不被毀滅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行事詭詐的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人倒不以詭詐待你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你毀滅罷休了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己必被毀滅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你行完了詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人必以詭詐待你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你施恩於我們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們等候你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你每早晨作我們的膀臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭難的時候為我們的拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喧嚷的響聲一發，眾民奔逃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你一興起，列國四散。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們所擄的必被斂盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像螞蚱吃","poem":1},{"noteId":29},{"text":"盡禾稼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人要蹦在其上，好像蝗蟲一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華被尊崇，因他居在高處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他以公平公義充滿錫安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你一生一世必得安穩－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有豐盛的救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並智慧和知識；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你以敬畏耶和華為至寶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"看哪，他們的豪傑在外頭哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求和的使臣痛痛哭泣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大路荒涼，行人止息；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人背約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不顧人民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上悲哀衰殘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩羞愧枯乾；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙崙像曠野；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊和迦密的樹林凋殘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華對敵人的警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在我要起來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要興起；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要勃然而興。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要懷的是糠詷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要生的是碎稭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的氣就是吞滅自己的火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦必像已燒的石灰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像已割的荊棘在火中焚燒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們遠方的人當聽我所行的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們近處的人當承認我的大能。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安中的罪人都懼怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不敬虔的人被戰兢抓住。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們中間誰能與吞滅的火同住？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們中間誰能與永火同住呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行事公義、說話正直、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎惡欺壓的財利、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擺手不受賄賂、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"塞耳不聽流血的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"閉眼不看邪惡事的，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必居高處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的保障是磐石的堅壘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的糧必不缺乏","poem":1},{"noteId":30},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的水必不斷絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["光榮的將來"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"你的眼必見王的榮美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必見遼闊之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的心必思想那驚嚇的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自問說：記數目的在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平貢銀的在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"數戍樓的在哪裏呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不見那強暴的民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是說話深奧，你不能明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"言語呢喃，你不能懂得的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要看錫安－我們守聖節的城！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眼必見耶路撒冷為安靜的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為不挪移的帳幕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"橛子永不拔出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繩索一根也不折斷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裏，耶和華必顯威嚴與我們同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當作江河寬闊之地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中必沒有盪槳搖櫓的船來往，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有威武的船經過。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，耶和華是審判我們的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是給我們設律法的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是我們的王；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必拯救我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"你的繩索鬆開：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能栽穩桅杆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能揚起篷來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時許多擄來的物被分了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瘸腿的把掠物奪去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城內居民必不說：我病了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中居住的百姓，罪孽都赦免了。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":29,"caller":"-","text":"原文是斂","reference":{"chapter":33,"verse":4}},{"noteId":30,"caller":"-","text":"原文是賜給","reference":{"chapter":33,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/33.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/34.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/32.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}